{"d":"Ce bungalow s2 de 174 m² superficie situé 2 min à la plage. offre un cadre de vie agréable et confortable.\nIl dispose d’une terrasse de 95 m², parfaite pour se relaxer ou partager des moments agréables en plein air.\nLa partie nuit comprend deux chambres à coucher, idéales pour un espace intime et reposant.\nVous trouverez une salle de bain, ainsi qu’un point d’eau pratique.\nCe bien est parfait pour un projet d'investissement ou d'habitation .","ph":["https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/87e13521-8e49-40fa-b8e4-4c8168e67ffc_80455615.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/1a91c872-7ad0-4006-b20e-cdb2ca85135c_80455604.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/8de6080b-d862-4cec-810c-39865a5d9a06_80455605.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/7d802325-dc28-44f8-a0ec-d32ba256f667_80455606.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/657f3284-84bd-49f9-adf6-7c917e8cc038_80455607.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/78790a0f-cacd-4fec-8b06-44d1ac508300_80455608.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/3c6fc053-b1cc-4fd4-bb4e-4187869669bf_80455609.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/10e80781-c407-44b7-aa6d-476c3c40cd90_80455610.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/d5a0756d-290b-495a-a4f8-3c14b40db95b_80455611.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/74076829-30c4-43ce-b02b-94761dbf57cf_80455612.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/b7da4a88-277b-42d2-b437-8812b7b2a12e_80455613.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/a0c290d5-7eca-48c2-b9bc-8208e2ec9562_80455614.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/a0e18af4-03ab-4421-b7b3-ef1c75bdd516_80455616.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/7434c271-006e-4a3a-ba90-941fdb9f967c_80455617.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/d6fd530b-c1b4-4b1d-aab4-fb6d331507f3_80455618.jpg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/8/159/632F/h/b4df199a-7027-42b4-b